F][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]agents_query_unification.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/agents_query_unification.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-zf[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-zf/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Shared agents-live query profile and row adapter[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]shared-profile[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]shared-profile: factor shared agent query field specs out of the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Artifacts agents schema, add the agents-live boolean profile and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]live-row query adapter, and pin Python/Rust conformance goldens for the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]new dialect.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust-backed committed-query engine behind a sunset flag[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]live-engine[dim] · [dim][/dim]after shared-profile[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]live-engine: swap the Agents tab committed-query parse/evaluate path to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the agents-live profile behind a new sunset feature flag, using an [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]off-thread Rust corpus index, tree-preserving match masks, and last-good[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]error handling.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Load-path pushdown parity and secondary query consumers[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]consumers-and-pushdown[dim] · [dim][/dim]after live-engine[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]consumers-and-pushdown: compile the new dialect into the existing Rust [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]candidate-filter pushdown with window-safety parity, and migrate the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]machines-pane writer, project seeding, unread-jump, neighbor, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prospective-clan consumers to the shared match-mask facade.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Auto-hiding FilterBar chrome on the Agents tab[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]filter-bar-ui[dim] · [dim][/dim]after live-engine, consumers-and-pushdown[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]filter-bar-ui: replace the query-edit modal with an auto-hiding [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]FilterBar plus a highlighted canonical query readout in the existing [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]info panel, wiring live preview, completions, saved slots, query [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]history, and the keybinding, footer, and help-modal updates.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Documentation rewrite and verification sweep[/bold #D7AFFF]                  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs-and-sweep[dim] · [dim][/dim]after filter-bar-ui[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs-and-sweep: rewrite the user docs for the unified dialect including [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the legacy-token migration table, refresh the help-modal syntax section [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and configuration reference, and run the final perf and visual snapshot [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sweep.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-zf","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-zf.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-5a0c2a37a8ae3657725f78c3c44e47c2","started_at":"2026-09-10T22:04:00.106178+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"10cb444d4430e8cec5705725a6d70c6a067f074ce25